      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Adora is going to save Catra. Or at least, thatâ€™s what she thought before it all fell apart. One huge mistake leaves Adora broken and Horde Prime victoriousâ€¦ until She-Raâ€™s magic changes everything. With one last desperate chance, Adora attempts to rescue Catra again. And again. And again.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;or:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Save the Cat, on a time loop.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
